      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Unfortunately, the current quality of imposters is extremely poor, and there are cases where avatars appear broken or completely naked. Being able to set the traditional fallback reduces the likelihood of such “accidents.”",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
